WEBVTT

00:14.280 --> 00:16.410
[Huizhou, During the Jiajing Reign
of the Ming Dynasty]

00:19.600 --> 00:20.760
Sir, tea, please.

00:21.390 --> 00:22.320
Coming!

00:23.190 --> 00:24.000
Here is your Tunlyu Tea.

00:24.000 --> 00:25.060
Enjoy, gentlemen.

00:29.000 --> 00:29.870
Roasted chestnuts!

00:29.870 --> 00:31.390
Sweet chestnuts!

00:33.150 --> 00:34.280
Here are your steamed buns.

00:34.280 --> 00:35.030
Take care.

00:44.560 --> 00:45.960
Zhen, hello.

00:49.260 --> 00:53.410
[Li Zhen, granddaughter
of the eighth branch of the Li family]

01:14.150 --> 01:17.760
Zhen, wait for me!

01:17.789 --> 01:19.710
Zhen, wait for me!

01:19.480 --> 01:22.470
[Young Li Zhen]

01:19.710 --> 01:21.920
Little Zhen, slow down!

01:22.230 --> 01:23.140
Zhen!

01:23.789 --> 01:26.480
Zhen, wait for me!

01:37.350 --> 01:38.070
Uncle,

01:38.150 --> 01:39.150
I'd like a guozi.

01:39.229 --> 01:39.759
Sure.

01:39.840 --> 01:41.100
Let me wrap one for you.

01:41.710 --> 01:43.170
Where are you going, Zhen?

01:43.350 --> 01:44.479
I'm going to watch the ink competition.

01:44.479 --> 01:44.950
Okay.

01:45.920 --> 01:46.680
Be careful.

03:06.180 --> 03:10.810
[The Heir]

03:11.250 --> 03:13.830
[Episode 1]

03:14.710 --> 03:17.910
Bad karma in a past life condemns one
to be born in Huizhou.

03:18.560 --> 03:21.910
You get thrown out of the house
at the age of 13 or 14.

03:22.560 --> 03:25.870
So many men from Huizhou leave home young,

03:26.470 --> 03:30.240
backed by their clans
to trade around the world.

03:30.630 --> 03:33.800
That is why they say
"no Huizhou merchants, no towns."

03:34.470 --> 03:35.840
Now let's talk about

03:36.150 --> 03:37.680
the treasures of Huizhou.

03:38.030 --> 03:40.000
First, we have Hui Ink.

03:40.400 --> 03:42.120
When it comes to Hui Ink,

03:42.430 --> 03:44.840
the Luo, Li, Chen,
and Pan families stand out.

03:44.840 --> 03:46.150
So you might ask,

03:46.560 --> 03:50.030
which of these four
is the leader in Hui Ink?

03:50.960 --> 03:54.310
Manager of Luo's Ink Workshop,
Luo Hanzhang.

03:57.250 --> 03:58.510
[Luo Hanzhang, Manager of Luo Ink]

03:58.340 --> 04:01.660
Manager of Li's Ink Workshop, Li Jinshui.

03:58.510 --> 04:00.080
[Hair Net: The headpiece the man is wearing in this scene.
It was a typical Ming Dynasty accessory used by adult men to bind and cover their hair.]

04:00.080 --> 04:02.510
[Eighth Master Li, Li Jinshui,
Manager of Li Ink]

04:02.870 --> 04:03.800
Present the ink.

04:04.550 --> 04:06.270
[Ziji Dragon Light Ink]

04:06.730 --> 04:08.350
[The Way of Tao]

04:24.090 --> 04:27.540
[Li Jinhe (Sixth Master Li) of the Sixth Branch of the Li family]
[Li Jingdong, the eldest son of the Six Branch]

04:28.450 --> 04:31.420
[Luo Wensong,
the eldest son of the Luo family]

04:32.580 --> 04:35.870
[Li Jingfu, the only son
of the Eighth Branch of the Li family]

04:36.000 --> 04:36.800
Where is Zhen?

05:25.310 --> 05:26.310
Lord Huang.

05:26.480 --> 05:27.480
Lord Liu.

05:27.680 --> 05:29.190
This is the Luo family's

05:29.510 --> 05:31.040
Ziji Dragon Light Ink.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.830
Its ingredients include

05:31.830 --> 05:34.840
[Huang Boyang, Ink Affairs Official]

05:32.940 --> 05:34.909
pearl powder and gold leaf,

05:35.020 --> 05:38.390
giving the ink
a naturally shimmering golden glow.

05:38.800 --> 05:40.510
The flood dragon painted with it

05:40.510 --> 05:42.750
looks cloaked in radiant clouds,

05:42.830 --> 05:46.920
as if it just soared from the sea.

05:47.310 --> 05:48.510
It is indeed fine ink.

05:49.120 --> 05:50.000
However,

05:50.390 --> 05:52.920
a flood dragon
is still a dragon after all.

05:53.680 --> 05:55.750
It's too ethereal and lively,

05:57.000 --> 05:59.040
missing some of the ink's "bone."

06:03.240 --> 06:04.390
My Lords,

06:04.750 --> 06:06.830
this is the Li family's pine soot ink,

06:07.040 --> 06:08.480
named "the Way of Tao."

06:08.920 --> 06:11.920
It is worthy of the Li Ink
with its ancient heritage.

06:12.190 --> 06:15.650
One can tell at a glance that its color
is elegant and profound,

06:15.800 --> 06:18.480
full of depth and gravitas.

06:18.870 --> 06:20.750
Undoubtedly a top-tier ink.

06:21.270 --> 06:22.680
Although it is fine ink,

06:22.950 --> 06:24.680
its darkness is overwhelming,

06:24.830 --> 06:26.430
losing a touch of vitality.

06:27.360 --> 06:28.620
It has the "bone" of ink

06:28.800 --> 06:30.240
but lacks soul.

06:30.390 --> 06:31.270
Lord Huang,

06:31.430 --> 06:32.680
so it seems

06:32.830 --> 06:34.070
both inks

06:34.360 --> 06:37.240
have their flaws.

06:37.430 --> 06:38.240
Lord Liu,

06:38.390 --> 06:39.630
that's not quite right.

06:39.630 --> 06:42.360
Ink with both bone and soul

06:42.480 --> 06:44.920
is rare in this world.

06:46.120 --> 06:49.430
And in your view?

06:50.720 --> 06:51.600
Luo Ink:

06:51.630 --> 06:52.760
Superior Grade One.

06:56.680 --> 06:57.560
Li Ink:

06:58.630 --> 06:59.950
Superior Grade One.

07:06.560 --> 07:07.360
Everyone,

07:07.680 --> 07:09.750
in today's ink competition,

07:10.000 --> 07:11.600
the ink of the Luo and Li families

07:11.600 --> 07:14.510
is evenly matched,
hard to tell which is superior.

07:15.190 --> 07:17.120
The result puts me

07:17.750 --> 07:19.150
in a difficult position.

07:20.950 --> 07:23.150
I have a way to distinguish the quality!

07:23.950 --> 07:24.800
Nonsense!

07:25.000 --> 07:26.480
Whose ignorant child is this?

07:26.480 --> 07:27.610
Behaving so unruly!

07:27.630 --> 07:29.120
Guards! Throw her out!

07:29.160 --> 07:31.360
Zhen, why are you here?

07:31.620 --> 07:32.450
Li Jinshui.

07:32.830 --> 07:35.270
This is no place for children to play.

07:35.430 --> 07:37.070
Bringing a child in here,

07:37.310 --> 07:40.070
are you treating
the Tribute Ink Competition as a joke?

07:40.070 --> 07:41.360
My Lord, please forgive me.

07:41.360 --> 07:44.040
It is my fault
for failing to teach my child properly.

07:44.040 --> 07:46.270
I will punish her severely when we return,

07:46.270 --> 07:47.930
and discipline her strictly.

07:48.070 --> 07:48.920
Little girl.

07:49.430 --> 07:50.760
From what you just said,

07:51.000 --> 07:53.950
it seems you have an idea.

07:54.560 --> 07:55.270
Tell us.

07:55.510 --> 07:56.630
If it works,

07:57.070 --> 07:58.800
I will overlook this offense.

07:59.800 --> 08:01.480
Since one test wasn't enough,

08:01.560 --> 08:03.890
let's try again
using the Five Hues of Ink.

08:04.390 --> 08:07.120
Grandpa said the greatest truths
are the simplest.

08:07.120 --> 08:10.160
Dense, rich, heavy, light, clear—

08:10.560 --> 08:12.750
with the five hues on paper,

08:12.770 --> 08:15.570
the quality of the ink
becomes immediately clear.

08:23.230 --> 08:25.870
The Luo family's ink smudged at the edges.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.310
Li Ink wins!

08:34.750 --> 08:36.150
When it comes to Hui Ink,

08:36.600 --> 08:38.919
the Luo, Li, Chen,
and Pan families stand out.

08:38.919 --> 08:40.250
So you might ask,

08:40.600 --> 08:44.030
which of these four
is the leader in Hui Ink?

08:44.670 --> 08:45.730
As the saying goes,

08:46.000 --> 08:48.200
"Gold may be easy to come by,

08:48.270 --> 08:51.150
but Li Ink is hard to find!"

08:51.550 --> 08:54.200
"Gold may be easy to come by,
but Li Ink is hard to find!"

08:54.200 --> 08:57.320
Congratulations to the Li family
for winning the Tribute Ink rights!

08:57.320 --> 08:59.910
"Gold may be easy to come by,
but Li Ink is hard to find."

08:59.910 --> 09:02.670
Congratulations to the Li family
for winning the Tribute Ink rights!

09:02.670 --> 09:03.960
Daddy, I'm tired.

09:03.960 --> 09:04.720
I want a piggyback ride.

09:04.720 --> 09:05.840
Thank you.

09:06.550 --> 09:07.320
Congratulations.

09:07.320 --> 09:07.910
Thank you.

09:07.910 --> 09:08.840
Congratulations.

09:08.840 --> 09:09.960
Thank you.

09:21.790 --> 09:24.050
Look at her,
not acting like a girl at all.

09:24.390 --> 09:25.080
Congratulations.

09:25.080 --> 09:25.960
Congratulations to Li Ink.

09:25.960 --> 09:26.670
Congratulations.

09:26.670 --> 09:27.720
Thank you.

09:28.030 --> 09:28.910
Here, a reward.

09:28.400 --> 09:32.350
[Wang Rujun, Madam of the Seventh Branch,
Head of the Li family]

09:29.080 --> 09:29.790
Congratulations.

09:29.790 --> 09:30.790
Thank you.

09:30.790 --> 09:31.520
Congratulations.

09:31.520 --> 09:32.030
Thank you.

09:32.030 --> 09:32.960
Congratulations.

09:32.960 --> 09:33.790
Reward.

09:34.240 --> 09:35.240
Thank you.

09:35.270 --> 09:36.070
Here it comes!

09:36.080 --> 09:37.440
Rewards for everyone!

09:37.840 --> 09:38.720
Thank you!

09:49.600 --> 09:50.530
Sister-in-law.

09:50.840 --> 09:52.240
Thanks for your work today.

09:52.240 --> 09:53.200
Not at all.

09:54.070 --> 09:58.230
[Huang ying, daughter-in-law of the Sixth Branch
of the Li family, Li Jingdong's wife]

09:54.360 --> 09:56.720
Use fresh bamboo shoots
with the mandarin fish today.

09:56.720 --> 09:57.910
Cut them a bit finer.

09:58.120 --> 09:58.650
Okay.

09:59.690 --> 10:03.500
[Sun Wanyi, eldest daughter-in-law
of the Seventh Branch, Li Jingyuan's widow]

09:59.840 --> 10:02.790
I heard Lord Huang
is originally from Lingnan.

10:03.040 --> 10:05.440
Go easy on the salt
for all the dishes today.

10:05.440 --> 10:06.000
Got it.

10:10.000 --> 10:10.360
Jiangyue.

10:10.360 --> 10:11.200
Jingqi.

10:11.440 --> 10:13.030
I heard that
during the ink competition today,

10:13.030 --> 10:15.510
that girl from the Eighth Branch
stole all the spotlight.

10:14.210 --> 10:17.960
[Tian Jiangyue, Second daughter-in-law
of the Seventh Branch, Li Jingqi's wife]

10:16.720 --> 10:18.270
Tonight,
when the Ink Affairs Official comes,

10:18.270 --> 10:19.840
you must perform well.

10:20.270 --> 10:22.600
The future of the Seventh Branch,
the main family line,

10:22.600 --> 10:23.870
rests entirely on your shoulders.

10:23.870 --> 10:24.670
Jiangyue,

10:24.690 --> 10:28.400
[Li Jingqi, second son
of the Seventh Branch]

10:25.000 --> 10:27.240
I will take care of family matters.

10:27.550 --> 10:29.750
However, with Sixth Uncle
and Eighth Uncle around,

10:29.750 --> 10:31.350
there won't be any problems.

10:31.790 --> 10:33.440
That's not what I meant.

10:33.870 --> 10:35.550
You are such a blockhead.

10:36.150 --> 10:36.960
Jiangyue,

10:37.440 --> 10:38.720
I know what you're thinking,

10:38.720 --> 10:41.510
but we are all part of the Li family.

10:41.840 --> 10:45.100
Drawing such clear lines
between branches seems distant.

10:48.750 --> 10:49.680
Sister-in-law.

10:50.240 --> 10:51.170
Sister-in-law.

10:51.270 --> 10:52.670
Cut this a bit smaller.

10:52.750 --> 10:53.670
Keep working.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.170
Sister-in-law.

10:57.480 --> 10:59.360
Regarding the seating
for tonight's banquet,

10:59.360 --> 11:00.890
how has Mother arranged it?

11:01.440 --> 11:02.320
After all, Jingqi

11:02.320 --> 11:04.200
is the head of our Seventh Branch.

11:04.390 --> 11:07.480
Eventually, the Li family
will be entrusted to him.

11:08.000 --> 11:10.870
So,
regarding the seat next to Lord Huang...

11:10.870 --> 11:13.600
Mother is in charge of
the banquet arrangements.

11:13.790 --> 11:15.590
You don't need to worry about it.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.550
I have work to do.

11:25.630 --> 11:26.390
Who is it?

11:28.870 --> 11:30.270
Where did this come from?

11:32.510 --> 11:34.570
I don't know how this chicken got out.

11:34.630 --> 11:35.790
Did it scare you, Jiangyue?

11:35.790 --> 11:37.320
Can you be more careful?

11:37.870 --> 11:38.790
Jin,

11:38.790 --> 11:40.270
I've noticed that these livestock

11:40.270 --> 11:42.000
seem particularly obedient
when they see you.

11:42.000 --> 11:43.600
Sister-in-law, Ying.

11:43.180 --> 11:48.110
[Zhao Jin, daughter-in-law
of the Eighth Branch, Li Jingfu's wife]

11:44.000 --> 11:45.600
I'm good at this kind of work.

11:45.790 --> 11:46.390
This chicken,

11:46.390 --> 11:48.000
paired with the shi'er mushrooms
from my family in Yi County,

11:48.000 --> 11:49.150
will make a perfect pot of soup.

11:49.150 --> 11:49.720
Yes.

11:49.790 --> 11:50.550
Li,

11:50.550 --> 11:51.950
take it and slaughter it.

11:51.960 --> 11:53.320
No need, no need for anyone else.

11:53.320 --> 11:53.910
I'm good at it.

11:53.910 --> 11:54.870
I can slaughter it right away.

11:54.870 --> 11:56.530
It will definitely be ready
before the banquet starts.

11:56.530 --> 11:57.660
Jin, let me help you.

12:01.750 --> 12:03.510
But my newly made jacket...

12:03.840 --> 12:05.550
It almost got scratched by it.

12:25.500 --> 12:28.240
[Luo Wenqian,
the second son of the Luo family]

12:25.720 --> 12:27.150
It's so beautiful.

12:47.870 --> 12:49.300
Where did this little beggar come from?

12:49.300 --> 12:51.030
Pay me back for my fish lantern!

12:51.110 --> 12:52.460
I didn't do it on purpose.

12:52.460 --> 12:53.570
Why did you push me?

12:53.600 --> 12:54.720
You broke it!

12:54.840 --> 12:55.720
You broke it!

12:55.750 --> 12:56.720
You broke it!

12:57.440 --> 12:58.690
And you still won't admit it!

12:58.690 --> 13:00.420
Pay me back for my fish lantern!

13:00.670 --> 13:02.120
Why are you bullying him?

13:02.150 --> 13:03.680
It's none of your business!

13:03.790 --> 13:04.840
Are you alright?

13:05.270 --> 13:07.320
This little beggar broke my fish lantern.

13:07.320 --> 13:08.390
I didn't mean to.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.910
I thought it was something serious.

13:11.910 --> 13:12.790
Take mine.

13:12.910 --> 13:14.270
Don't hit him anymore.

13:16.670 --> 13:17.510
Let's go.

13:22.150 --> 13:23.120
Thank you.

13:23.270 --> 13:25.390
When I go back
and get money from my big brother,

13:25.390 --> 13:27.270
I'll buy a fish lantern to pay you back.

13:27.270 --> 13:28.670
If you really want to thank me,

13:28.670 --> 13:30.150
do me a favor too.

13:31.480 --> 13:33.210
It is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

13:33.510 --> 13:35.910
Lord Huang,
your presence in my humble home

13:36.080 --> 13:38.510
is a blessing for the entire Li clan.

13:38.510 --> 13:41.000
Come, everyone, raise your glasses.

13:41.120 --> 13:42.910
Let's welcome Lord Huang.

13:43.150 --> 13:44.960
Welcome, Lord Huang.

13:46.870 --> 13:49.360
I have long heard
that you manage your household well.

13:49.360 --> 13:50.360
Now that I see you today,

13:50.360 --> 13:51.630
I know it's true.

13:51.720 --> 13:53.360
You have an extraordinary bearing.

13:53.360 --> 13:54.890
You flatter me, Lord Huang.

13:55.240 --> 13:58.840
My husband Jintai and eldest son Jingyuan
have both passed away.

13:59.030 --> 14:00.440
I am just a woman,

14:00.510 --> 14:03.040
merely taking care
of some domestic affairs.

14:04.390 --> 14:05.270
Lord Huang.

14:05.790 --> 14:08.910
That Li Ink
won the Tribute Ink honor this time

14:09.080 --> 14:10.600
was entirely thanks to the efforts

14:10.600 --> 14:14.080
of the disciples from the various families
in the ink workshop.

14:14.080 --> 14:16.340
Li Ink has been passed down for a century.

14:16.510 --> 14:18.110
I heard that in the Li family,

14:18.390 --> 14:19.910
the First to Fifth Branches

14:19.910 --> 14:21.750
are no longer in the ink industry.

14:21.750 --> 14:24.600
Only the Sixth, Seventh,
and Eighth Branches remain

14:24.600 --> 14:26.130
to continue the ink legacy.

14:26.320 --> 14:27.270
Nowadays,

14:27.670 --> 14:30.870
Eighth Master Li is the head
of the Five Talents of the age.

14:31.120 --> 14:34.750
I believe Li Ink
will surely endure and prosper.

14:38.870 --> 14:39.630
Over here.

14:44.790 --> 14:46.320
This melon is so strange.

14:46.320 --> 14:47.360
It's flat.

14:47.550 --> 14:48.080
This one too.

14:48.080 --> 14:49.480
It's not that big either.

14:51.320 --> 14:53.240
Someone's coming. Run!

14:53.480 --> 14:54.550
What are you doing?

14:54.550 --> 14:55.240
Stealing melons?

14:55.240 --> 14:56.320
Sister, let's go!

14:56.320 --> 14:58.380
It's called "Harvest Eve Foraging!"

14:58.390 --> 14:59.630
It's only called "Harvest Eve Foraging"
when adults are doing it!

14:59.630 --> 15:00.910
You are just stealing melons!

15:00.910 --> 15:01.670
Don't go!

15:02.000 --> 15:02.870
Stop!

15:06.510 --> 15:07.270
Stop!

15:09.440 --> 15:10.080
Watch out!

15:11.720 --> 15:12.510
Go this way.

15:20.960 --> 15:22.440
Your arm is hurt.

15:22.440 --> 15:24.770
We need to stop the bleeding immediately.

15:24.960 --> 15:26.150
I came today

15:26.510 --> 15:28.120
firstly to offer congratulations,

15:28.120 --> 15:31.870
and secondly to remind you,
Eighth Master Li and Old Seventh Madam.

15:32.030 --> 15:35.000
Since the date for sending the Tribute Ink
to the Capital is set,

15:35.000 --> 15:37.510
you must make arrangements in advance.

15:37.960 --> 15:40.600
Only when the Tribute Ink
arrives safely in the Capital

15:40.600 --> 15:43.030
will the mission
be considered a complete success.

15:43.030 --> 15:45.240
This wine is quite cold.

15:45.440 --> 15:47.600
I will go to the kitchen
to give instructions,

15:47.600 --> 15:49.630
lest Lord Huang thinks we are poor hosts.

15:49.630 --> 15:51.160
Thank you for your trouble.

15:53.720 --> 15:54.650
Is anyone there?

15:54.910 --> 15:56.080
No one. No one.

15:56.080 --> 15:56.910
Come here.

16:06.960 --> 16:07.670
Come here.

16:15.200 --> 16:17.720
Regarding the delivery of Tribute Ink
to the Capital this time,

16:17.720 --> 16:19.390
I already have a plan in mind.

16:20.030 --> 16:22.030
Thank you for the reminder, My Lord.

16:22.670 --> 16:23.600
Please, Lord Huang.

16:23.600 --> 16:24.320
Alright.

16:26.360 --> 16:28.440
Li Ink has been passed down for centuries.

16:28.440 --> 16:30.700
It relies on the unity of the entire clan.

16:30.760 --> 16:32.090
Jingfu of the Eighth Branch,

16:32.090 --> 16:34.750
my son Jingqi,
and Jingdong of the Sixth Branch.

16:35.360 --> 16:37.240
This delivery of ink to the Capital

16:37.240 --> 16:40.480
is entrusted to you three brothers.

16:40.840 --> 16:44.320
You must work together
and fulfill your duties faithfully.

16:44.480 --> 16:46.120
After the Tribute Ink is delivered,

16:46.120 --> 16:49.270
I hope for your safe and early return.

16:49.840 --> 16:50.670
Yes.

16:51.150 --> 16:53.510
Since you have arranged it so securely,

16:54.270 --> 16:55.840
I can rest assured.

16:57.390 --> 16:59.240
There is one more thing.

16:59.360 --> 17:02.000
I have been in charge
of the Li family for many years

17:02.000 --> 17:04.440
and have reached the age to enjoy
the company of my grandchildren

17:04.440 --> 17:06.510
and live out my days in peace.

17:06.790 --> 17:07.920
Jingqi, my son,

17:08.200 --> 17:09.960
when you return
from delivering the tribute,

17:09.960 --> 17:12.550
I will pass the responsibility
of leading the Li family

17:12.550 --> 17:14.030
into your hands.

17:14.200 --> 17:17.660
I hope you will redouble your efforts
and live up to this trust.

17:18.310 --> 17:19.510
Yes, Mother.

17:20.109 --> 17:22.880
It will be a double celebration.

17:23.030 --> 17:25.030
If you are free, Lord Huang,

17:25.240 --> 17:29.790
please come to witness
the Li family's succession ceremony.

17:29.880 --> 17:30.750
Very well.

17:30.960 --> 17:33.790
How could I miss such a joyous occasion?

17:34.110 --> 17:34.680
Here.

17:34.790 --> 17:35.350
Here.

17:38.590 --> 17:39.790
Wait for me to grind the ink,

17:39.790 --> 17:41.190
and I'll apply it for you.

17:41.550 --> 17:42.790
Ink can heal wounds?

17:43.030 --> 17:44.550
I've never heard of that.

17:44.790 --> 17:45.960
This rouge ink

17:45.960 --> 17:48.070
was made by my father for emergencies.

17:48.070 --> 17:49.270
It stops bleeding and reduces swelling.

17:49.270 --> 17:50.830
Your wound is a bit deep.

17:51.160 --> 17:51.960
Once applied,

17:52.030 --> 17:53.880
I'm afraid it won't come off.

18:03.070 --> 18:03.800
Does it hurt?

18:05.440 --> 18:07.030
No, not at all.

18:19.440 --> 18:20.400
Well then.

18:20.830 --> 18:22.310
It should be fine now.

18:25.270 --> 18:26.800
This rouge ink is yours now.

18:27.200 --> 18:30.000
Apply it two more times
and you'll be fully healed.

18:31.160 --> 18:32.000
Take it.

18:34.590 --> 18:35.400
Thank you.

18:39.860 --> 18:42.140
[Ink Manual]

18:43.720 --> 18:45.110
The books you read

18:45.960 --> 18:47.510
are similar to my brother's.

18:47.510 --> 18:48.590
You can read?

18:48.830 --> 18:50.790
I knew you weren't a beggar.

18:51.440 --> 18:53.100
Does your family make ink too?

18:53.510 --> 18:55.790
Why haven't I seen you before?

18:56.070 --> 18:57.330
My name is Luo Wenqian.

18:57.480 --> 18:58.940
My father is Luo Hanzhang.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.730
You're from the Luo family?

19:01.920 --> 19:03.510
I was raised in the Capital.

19:04.030 --> 19:06.000
Father wanted me
to study and become an official,

19:06.000 --> 19:07.130
but I didn't want to.

19:08.240 --> 19:09.920
Then what do you like to do?

19:10.200 --> 19:12.400
What are your ambitions for the future?

19:12.680 --> 19:13.200
I...

19:13.550 --> 19:14.640
I don't know.

19:15.240 --> 19:16.720
How can you not know?

19:17.070 --> 19:19.480
Everyone has something they like to do.

19:19.720 --> 19:21.440
My grandfather loved making ink.

19:21.440 --> 19:22.970
My father loves making ink.

19:23.160 --> 19:24.440
I like ink too.

19:25.160 --> 19:26.400
In the future, I want to become

19:26.400 --> 19:28.720
an ink master even better

19:28.720 --> 19:29.920
than my grandfather.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.690
I want everyone in Huizhou—

19:31.920 --> 19:32.400
no—

19:32.470 --> 19:34.640
everyone in Ming

19:34.880 --> 19:36.960
to know my name, Li Zhen.

19:37.240 --> 19:38.270
I believe you.

19:43.440 --> 19:45.160
I'll go get some food.

19:45.350 --> 19:46.280
Wait for me here.

19:54.550 --> 19:55.550
Stop right there.

20:01.440 --> 20:02.200
Zhen,

20:02.550 --> 20:04.550
where have you been fooling around?

20:04.590 --> 20:07.270
I went to watch the incense dragon dance.

20:07.270 --> 20:08.880
Watching the incense dragon dance?

20:08.880 --> 20:10.280
Why is your face so dirty?

20:10.720 --> 20:12.030
Didn't I tell you

20:12.110 --> 20:13.590
that I don't mind you playing,

20:13.590 --> 20:14.310
but?

20:14.920 --> 20:17.400
But I must not lie.

20:18.550 --> 20:19.270
Seventh Grandmother!

20:19.270 --> 20:21.070
Mother is going to hit me!

20:21.310 --> 20:22.240
Seventh Grandmother!

20:22.240 --> 20:23.750
Mother is going to hit me!

20:24.400 --> 20:25.400
Who wants to hit you?

20:25.400 --> 20:27.550
Your mother wouldn't bear to hit you.

20:29.720 --> 20:31.030
My little rascal.

20:31.030 --> 20:32.030
Where have you been playing?

20:32.030 --> 20:33.270
Zhen, come down.

20:33.310 --> 20:35.350
Seventh Grandmother
needs to discuss business with the adults.

20:35.350 --> 20:37.270
Your brothers would get scolded
if we didn't behave.

20:37.270 --> 20:38.960
Seventh Grandmother
has so many grandchildren,

20:38.960 --> 20:40.680
but I am the only granddaughter.

20:40.680 --> 20:42.510
I'm Seventh Grandmother's treasure.

20:42.510 --> 20:44.400
She wouldn't bear to scold me.

20:50.110 --> 20:52.910
It is a great joy that Li Ink
has won the first prize.

20:53.720 --> 20:57.110
Sending the ink to the Capital
is also a crucial matter.

20:57.680 --> 20:59.720
But everyone must remember

21:00.000 --> 21:01.400
the Li family rules.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.790
On every festive reunion day,

21:03.830 --> 21:05.960
we must test your knowledge of ink

21:05.960 --> 21:09.000
to continue
the Li family's ink-making legacy.

21:09.440 --> 21:11.700
There are four inksticks in front of you.

21:11.830 --> 21:15.400
Let's see who can identify them
by scent first.

21:16.230 --> 21:18.160
Zhengshen, you go first.

21:16.860 --> 21:19.990
[Li Zhengshen,
eldest grandson of the Sixth Branch]

21:19.640 --> 21:20.350
Go on.

21:24.960 --> 21:27.070
I... I don't know.

21:27.640 --> 21:28.440
Get back here.

21:29.270 --> 21:30.400
Don't scold him.

21:30.680 --> 21:32.080
When you glare like that,

21:32.210 --> 21:34.480
how can he identify the ink?

21:34.510 --> 21:36.070
He's scared out of his wits.

21:36.240 --> 21:37.070
Zhengliang,

21:37.750 --> 21:38.680
it's your turn.

21:39.400 --> 21:39.930
Go ahead.

21:44.010 --> 21:46.590
[Li Zhengliang,
eldest grandson of the Eighth Branch]

21:51.640 --> 21:52.960
I can't tell either.

21:53.270 --> 21:54.200
Idiot!

21:54.590 --> 21:56.030
Why are you glaring at him?

21:56.030 --> 21:57.000
When you glare,

21:57.000 --> 21:58.680
how can he identify the ink?

21:58.750 --> 21:59.110
Brother,

21:59.110 --> 21:59.970
let me help you.

22:00.830 --> 22:01.490
Seriously.

22:05.550 --> 22:08.440
This ink contains
seashells and frankincense.

22:09.300 --> 22:11.600
It must be the Luo family's
best-seller in recent years,

22:11.600 --> 22:12.730
"White Jade Light."

22:15.030 --> 22:18.680
This one is infused
with plum blossom and osmanthus.

22:19.400 --> 22:20.960
It must be the Chen family's Scholar Ink,
known as

22:20.960 --> 22:24.160
"the gentleman among inks,"
symbolizing success in the imperial exams.

22:24.160 --> 22:24.960
Look at her.

22:25.960 --> 22:28.090
This one has a strong medicinal scent.

22:28.830 --> 22:30.760
On closer sniff, it smells of musk.

22:31.160 --> 22:33.160
This must be Jiangyun Mountain Ink.

22:39.480 --> 22:42.400
I brought this ink back from outside.

22:42.440 --> 22:43.480
It's not famous.

22:43.510 --> 22:45.680
It's understandable
if she can't recognize it.

22:45.680 --> 22:47.070
I remember now.

22:47.920 --> 22:49.640
I've seen this ink before.

22:49.920 --> 22:51.380
It's from the Tian family.

22:51.480 --> 22:52.680
Grandfather said that

22:52.680 --> 22:55.880
although the Tian family
opened an ink workshop recently

22:56.130 --> 22:57.810
and uses decent materials,

22:57.920 --> 22:59.830
they haven't put effort into studying

22:59.830 --> 23:01.230
how to make ink properly.

23:01.350 --> 23:02.680
So the ink they produce

23:02.790 --> 23:04.400
is always a mess.

23:07.280 --> 23:08.070
Seventh Grandmother,

23:08.070 --> 23:09.200
am I right?

23:09.520 --> 23:11.200
Yes, you are right.

23:11.220 --> 23:12.030
Wonderful.

23:12.030 --> 23:14.160
Zhen is so clever.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.750
Stop praising her.

23:15.750 --> 23:17.550
She'll get too big for her boots.

23:20.930 --> 23:22.160
Where did this child come from?

23:22.160 --> 23:22.750
Come here.

23:22.750 --> 23:23.960
Don't run around.

23:24.160 --> 23:24.790
You...

23:25.240 --> 23:26.270
Look at him. He...

23:28.640 --> 23:29.550
Seventh Grandmother,

23:29.550 --> 23:31.550
this is a new friend I made today.

23:32.000 --> 23:32.880
Zhen,

23:32.920 --> 23:35.200
you can't just bring strangers home.

23:35.400 --> 23:37.000
Look at his dirty face.

23:37.400 --> 23:39.830
People might think he is a street urchin.

23:39.830 --> 23:41.310
He is not a street urchin.

23:41.790 --> 23:43.160
His name is Luo Wenqian.

23:44.480 --> 23:45.590
Luo Wenqian?

23:46.000 --> 23:48.480
You are the second son of the Luo family?

23:50.880 --> 23:51.810
Stand straight.

23:53.880 --> 23:55.830
My son disturbed your feast.

23:56.200 --> 23:57.830
Please forgive the rudeness.

23:57.830 --> 23:59.290
I failed to raise him well.

23:59.750 --> 24:00.440
Tomorrow.

24:00.920 --> 24:02.750
Tomorrow, I will send someone

24:03.160 --> 24:04.640
with a gift of apology.

24:04.960 --> 24:06.790
It was no disturbance.

24:07.160 --> 24:09.400
Just children playing around.

24:10.070 --> 24:12.720
Old Master Luo,
please do not take it to heart.

24:13.030 --> 24:14.550
He rarely comes back.

24:14.680 --> 24:17.310
Let Zhen show him around.

24:18.590 --> 24:19.510
I'd love to.

24:20.720 --> 24:22.120
That won't be necessary.

24:22.480 --> 24:23.830
He has heavy schoolwork

24:24.310 --> 24:25.960
and is returning to the Capital soon.

24:25.960 --> 24:28.480
I'm afraid he won't come back.

24:31.270 --> 24:32.070
Farewell.

24:35.110 --> 24:37.270
Luo Wenqian, wait.

24:45.160 --> 24:46.760
This fish lantern is for you.

24:48.640 --> 24:49.440
Thank you.

24:55.920 --> 24:56.640
Goodbye.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.960
I told you to study at home,

25:20.010 --> 25:21.310
yet you ran to the Li family

25:21.310 --> 25:23.550
to hang out with that girl
from the Eighth Branch.

25:23.550 --> 25:25.680
Do you think
I haven't been embarrassed enough?

25:25.680 --> 25:26.480
Young Master.

25:26.880 --> 25:28.480
It's the Mid-Autumn Festival today.

25:28.480 --> 25:30.240
It looked lively outside,

25:30.480 --> 25:31.880
so I wanted to take a look.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.060
Give that to me.

25:35.480 --> 25:37.010
Give it to me! Do you hear me?

25:42.400 --> 25:44.480
Stay home and study hard.

25:44.640 --> 25:47.590
You are not to step outside
before we return to the Capital.

25:47.590 --> 25:48.270
Father,

25:48.480 --> 25:49.960
I don't want to go back to the Capital,

25:49.960 --> 25:51.270
nor do I want to take the imperial exams.

25:51.270 --> 25:52.200
How dare you!

25:52.510 --> 25:53.350
Say that again!

25:53.350 --> 25:53.920
Father.

25:55.310 --> 25:55.960
Look.

25:57.480 --> 25:58.480
I have here...

25:59.550 --> 26:01.030
another ink stick I made.

26:02.550 --> 26:03.550
How do you like it?

26:03.590 --> 26:04.830
Get out!

26:12.940 --> 26:14.260
Brat.

26:16.640 --> 26:18.240
Haven't I seen this already?

26:18.790 --> 26:19.680
You get out too.

26:20.830 --> 26:21.350
Okay.

26:46.440 --> 26:48.110
Then what do you like to do?

26:48.330 --> 26:50.530
What are your ambitions for the future?

26:50.680 --> 26:52.110
I like playing outside,

26:52.240 --> 26:54.000
with no one telling me what to do,

26:54.000 --> 26:56.550
and getting to see
all the excitement everywhere.

26:56.550 --> 26:58.590
Then just tell your family.

26:59.270 --> 27:01.110
But that's not a proper job.

27:01.720 --> 27:03.520
My father would surely scold me.

27:05.000 --> 27:06.510
Then you can tell him

27:06.790 --> 27:09.920
you want to be a traveling merchant.

27:10.350 --> 27:12.110
I love listening
to the visiting ink merchants

27:12.110 --> 27:13.110
telling stories.

27:13.200 --> 27:15.440
They've been to so many places

27:15.640 --> 27:18.200
and seen all the wonders of the world.

27:18.270 --> 27:19.870
Is everything you said real?

27:28.190 --> 27:33.100
[Two months later]

27:30.960 --> 27:35.890
The Huizhou Literary Association
congratulates the Li Ink on the succession ceremony!

27:36.070 --> 27:37.750
Li Ink has returned
from the tribute delivery.

27:37.750 --> 27:40.030
Li Jingqi of the Seventh Branch
is about to take over as clan head.

27:40.030 --> 27:41.270
That is truly a double blessing.

27:40.200 --> 27:43.860
[The Legacy Lives On]

27:42.880 --> 27:47.810
The Huizhou Literary Association congratulates
the Li Ink on the succession ceremony!

27:48.880 --> 27:49.920
Mother!

27:49.940 --> 27:51.030
Seventh Grandmother!

27:51.030 --> 27:51.720
Mother!

27:51.960 --> 27:53.200
Mother!

27:53.400 --> 27:54.830
Seventh Grandmother!

27:54.850 --> 27:56.240
Seventh Grandmother!

27:57.060 --> 27:57.790
My little Zhen.

27:57.790 --> 27:59.380
Seventh Grandmother, has the boat arrived?

27:59.380 --> 28:01.270
Where are my father and the others?

28:01.270 --> 28:03.240
Don't worry, little Zhen.

28:03.240 --> 28:04.790
They will be here soon.

28:04.920 --> 28:05.920
Now, come here.

28:06.200 --> 28:09.440
Warm up in my cloak.

28:09.790 --> 28:10.750
Take a look.

28:19.480 --> 28:23.400
The Huizhou Literary Association congratulates
the Li Ink on the succession ceremony!

28:23.400 --> 28:24.590
We wish you the carrying forward
of the legacy

28:24.590 --> 28:26.480
and everlasting glory!

28:26.790 --> 28:28.750
Thank you all.

28:29.790 --> 28:31.750
Seventh Grandmother, look!

28:31.770 --> 28:33.010
The boat is here!

28:33.160 --> 28:34.400
The boat is here!

28:35.370 --> 28:36.650
Start the drums!

29:41.750 --> 29:45.440
Jingqi... is gone!

30:03.480 --> 30:04.510
Seventh Aunt...

30:05.070 --> 30:07.680
It's all because of him.

30:09.310 --> 30:11.680
It's all because of Li Jingfu!

30:11.930 --> 30:13.450
He got drunk,

30:13.470 --> 30:15.550
ruined the Tribute Ink,

30:15.550 --> 30:17.350
and angered His Majesty!

30:18.110 --> 30:22.240
We were all thrown into prison,

30:22.440 --> 30:24.920
suffering daily torture.

30:27.960 --> 30:29.160
My legs...

30:29.960 --> 30:31.510
My legs...

30:33.830 --> 30:36.550
Poor Jingqi suffered even more.

30:36.750 --> 30:39.400
He was already weak and sickly,

30:39.880 --> 30:42.200
and then he caught a chill.

30:43.090 --> 30:46.480
How could he survive that?

30:47.750 --> 30:52.350
Fortunately, Lord Huang couldn't bear
to see the Li family suffer

30:52.700 --> 30:55.300
and made every effort
to mediate on our behalf.

30:56.200 --> 30:59.070
Li Ink was sentenced to pay heavy taxes
for 10 years.

30:59.790 --> 31:02.640
That's why we could return alive.

31:04.720 --> 31:05.880
All of this

31:06.480 --> 31:09.720
was due to Li Jingfu!

31:17.880 --> 31:19.720
Li Jingfu!

31:21.160 --> 31:22.310
It was you!

31:23.000 --> 31:25.400
You are the reason for Jingqi's death!

31:26.270 --> 31:28.350
Give Jingqi back to me!

31:28.810 --> 31:31.130
Give Jingqi back to me!

31:31.160 --> 31:31.880
Give Jingqi back to me!

31:31.880 --> 31:33.110
Jiangyue! Jiangyue!

31:33.110 --> 31:33.920
Jiangyue!

31:33.920 --> 31:34.640
Jiangyue! Jiangyue!

31:34.640 --> 31:36.110
Give Jingqi back to me!

31:36.110 --> 31:37.480
Jingfu is honest by nature.

31:37.480 --> 31:38.960
He could never mess things up
because of drinking.

31:38.960 --> 31:39.680
There must be...

31:39.680 --> 31:40.960
There must be some misunderstanding!

31:40.960 --> 31:42.400
There must be some misunderstanding!

31:42.400 --> 31:43.530
Misunderstanding?

31:44.000 --> 31:46.800
He's dead.
What misunderstanding could there be?

31:49.270 --> 31:51.890
Why wasn't it you who died?

31:51.920 --> 31:53.590
Why wasn't it you?

31:53.590 --> 31:55.110
Why?

31:59.160 --> 32:00.920
Why?

32:01.310 --> 32:02.160
Jingfu,

32:02.480 --> 32:03.480
say something.

32:04.270 --> 32:06.130
You were wrongly accused, right?

32:06.160 --> 32:07.400
Say something, Jingfu.

32:07.400 --> 32:08.920
You were wrongly accused!

32:09.110 --> 32:10.350
I was not.

32:12.030 --> 32:13.270
I was not.

32:15.920 --> 32:17.790
I was on duty that night.

32:19.200 --> 32:20.550
I did drink.

32:21.400 --> 32:22.240
But...

32:23.070 --> 32:25.310
I really checked everything

32:25.510 --> 32:26.880
inside and out

32:27.350 --> 32:28.550
before I went to rest.

32:29.550 --> 32:30.350
The ink!

32:30.920 --> 32:31.790
The ink!

32:31.960 --> 32:35.160
I don't know
why a fire broke out at midnight

32:35.750 --> 32:37.680
and destroyed all the Tribute Ink.

32:39.510 --> 32:41.110
No matter what,

32:41.480 --> 32:43.480
it was my negligence in supervision

32:43.480 --> 32:47.070
that caused Jingqi
to die unjustly in prison

32:47.640 --> 32:49.960
and Jingdong to injure his leg.

32:50.400 --> 32:51.160
I have failed

32:51.920 --> 32:54.750
the entire Li family.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.200
I am guilty.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.440
I deserve to die.

33:02.960 --> 33:07.480
You should have died instead of Jingqi!

33:10.030 --> 33:11.070
That's not true.

33:11.350 --> 33:12.070
Jingfu.

33:14.440 --> 33:15.070
Father.

33:15.750 --> 33:17.270
Say something, Father.

33:17.720 --> 33:20.050
You know Jingfu isn't that kind of person.

33:20.510 --> 33:22.200
Father, say something.

33:22.640 --> 33:24.680
Please say something, Father!

33:28.720 --> 33:29.830
Eighth Brother.

33:37.440 --> 33:39.310
Father!

33:39.920 --> 33:41.590
Father!

33:41.640 --> 33:43.310
Father!

33:49.110 --> 33:50.640
Today's accident happened

33:51.720 --> 33:53.380
because of the Eighth Branch.

33:55.270 --> 33:56.670
I will give the whole clan

33:57.510 --> 33:59.110
a proper account.

34:01.480 --> 34:02.880
Bring the punishing rod.

34:07.270 --> 34:08.670
Bring the punishing rod!

34:23.380 --> 34:23.969
Father!

34:26.440 --> 34:27.070
Father!

34:27.190 --> 34:27.840
Father!

34:32.840 --> 34:33.630
Jingfu!

34:55.100 --> 34:56.360
Seventh Grandmother!

34:56.630 --> 34:58.110
Seventh Grandmother!

34:58.190 --> 35:01.590
Please, stop hitting my father!

35:02.470 --> 35:03.930
Father, stop hitting him!

35:04.030 --> 35:06.230
You'll kill Jingfu
if you keep hitting him!

35:06.230 --> 35:07.960
If you must hit someone, hit me!

35:11.230 --> 35:12.960
I'm begging you!

35:13.230 --> 35:16.110
Please, say something!

35:17.360 --> 35:18.820
When a son makes a mistake,

35:19.630 --> 35:20.760
the father

35:20.960 --> 35:22.230
cannot escape the blame.

35:22.230 --> 35:23.360
His father will take

35:23.840 --> 35:25.370
the rest of the punishment.

35:25.440 --> 35:27.770
You Eighth Branch caused Jingqi's death.

35:28.280 --> 35:31.400
Do you think
a few lashes will write it off?

35:31.440 --> 35:33.070
Seventh Grandmother,

35:34.070 --> 35:37.280
don't you love me the most?

35:38.150 --> 35:40.630
You don't care about what others say.

35:40.630 --> 35:43.320
You only listen to me.

35:45.280 --> 35:46.000
Mother.

35:46.840 --> 35:48.640
The family rules are paramount.

35:50.280 --> 35:52.670
No one can break the Li family's rules!

35:54.280 --> 35:56.210
If you are a member of the Li family,

35:56.880 --> 35:59.340
you must accept
the Li family's punishment!

36:00.710 --> 36:03.440
Then I won't be a member
of the Li family anymore.

36:07.800 --> 36:08.710
Eighth Uncle.

36:09.440 --> 36:10.960
Today's matter

36:11.590 --> 36:13.630
is hard to resolve.

36:16.590 --> 36:18.590
Give the Sixth and Seventh Branches

36:19.590 --> 36:21.280
a proper account.

36:44.590 --> 36:45.510
Sixth Brother.

36:47.760 --> 36:48.630
Rujun.

36:52.150 --> 36:53.360
We Eighth Branch

36:54.480 --> 36:56.480
know our sins are heavy.

36:58.070 --> 36:59.400
We are ashamed...

36:59.960 --> 37:01.560
to face everyone in the clan.

37:06.030 --> 37:07.110
I volunteer...

37:09.230 --> 37:10.480
to be removed...

37:11.510 --> 37:12.800
from the family tree.

37:19.890 --> 37:28.890
[Li's Ancestral Hall]

38:06.500 --> 38:10.110
[Spirit Tablet of Jintai,
Head of the Li Family in Ming]

38:08.590 --> 38:10.000
Jintai...

38:11.630 --> 38:13.760
I've come to see you.

38:16.670 --> 38:20.190
Our Jingqi...

38:22.840 --> 38:25.480
has... passed away too.

38:26.880 --> 38:28.230
The Eighth Branch

38:29.190 --> 38:31.070
has been expelled from the clan.

38:34.520 --> 38:37.860
Li Ink, as the winner
of the Tribute Selection,

38:38.400 --> 38:40.800
bore the duty of guarding the Tribute Ink.

38:41.670 --> 38:44.110
However, during the transport
to the Capital,

38:44.110 --> 38:45.590
due to negligence,

38:45.960 --> 38:47.800
the Tribute Ink was destroyed.

38:48.630 --> 38:49.830
It is hereby ordered:

38:50.070 --> 38:53.130
The Li family is stripped
of the Tribute Ink privilege.

38:53.480 --> 38:55.010
Luo Ink shall take its place

38:55.840 --> 38:57.230
to supply the tribute.

38:58.550 --> 38:59.680
By imperial decree.

38:59.960 --> 39:01.360
Thank you, Your Majesty.

39:02.030 --> 39:03.440
Thank you, My Lord.

39:19.400 --> 39:22.670
[Champion of Ink Making]

39:23.630 --> 39:24.510
Take it down.

39:53.280 --> 39:54.680
The Huizhou ink industry

39:56.000 --> 39:57.320
is about to change.

40:13.190 --> 40:15.320
-Eighth Master Li.
-Eighth Master Li.

40:53.070 --> 40:54.320
Eighth Master Li.

41:01.190 --> 41:03.320
-Eighth Master Li.
-Eighth Master Li.

41:03.480 --> 41:04.480
I, Jinshui,

41:05.550 --> 41:06.510
am ashamed.

41:08.630 --> 41:09.960
I have failed everyone.

41:37.380 --> 41:40.160
[Li Ink]

41:45.280 --> 41:46.280
Rujun.

41:58.230 --> 41:59.280
From now on,

42:00.480 --> 42:01.680
the Li's Ink Workshop

42:08.280 --> 42:09.680
will be entrusted to you.

42:25.710 --> 42:26.670
Eighth Brother.

42:27.510 --> 42:28.710
These ink recipes

42:29.110 --> 42:31.510
are your life's work.

42:35.840 --> 42:38.590
You should keep them.

42:41.590 --> 42:42.590
Thank you

42:43.360 --> 42:44.710
for your trust.

42:45.280 --> 42:46.360
These ink recipes

42:47.320 --> 42:48.670
will be buried with me.
